# Holds come twice, the bridge restarts, players come and go and the
# modescript restarts. The driver decides nothing twice and goes on as if
# nothing happened.
mode knockout
settings {"lives": 2, "rounds_without_elimination": 1}
players a b c
watchers s
later d
repeat-holds on
round a 30 | b 31 | c dnf 1
join d
restart-bridge
round a 30 | d 31 | b 32 | c 33
leave c
repeat-holds off
round a 30 | b 31 | d 32
restart-script
round a 30 | b 31 | d 32
round a 30 | b 31 | d 32
